		/AGMCORE_&sysmakepattern systemdict/makepattern get def
		/AGMCORE_&usrmakepattern/makepattern load def
	}if
	/currentcmykcolor[0 0 0 0]AGMCORE_gput
	/currentstrokeadjust false AGMCORE_gput
